{"title":"Tundra Mammoth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 50 Mammoth that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (16.7% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth?lv=50\">Lv 50 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth?lv=50\" title=\"Pick level 50\"><td><b>50</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>303</td><td>32</td><td>2,500</td><td class=\"muted\">909 · 44.8 · 7,500</td><td>4</td><td>in the wilds around 488, -791</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth?lv=51\" title=\"Pick level 51\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 485, -790</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 112 total, 53–59 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×53–59</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mammoth-ivory\" title=\"Mammoth Ivory - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/5b5ea269b02209827643.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mammoth Ivory</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-torso\" title=\"Dragonhide Torso - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c0c11b01db6e83ae53a8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3520.6px,415.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/12/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3072px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/12/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3072px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:3569.2px;top:-438.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:3484.5px;top:-382.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:3536.5px;top:-452.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:3522.8px;top:-415.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:3490.0px;top:-386.4px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 489, -792 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"tundra-mammoth\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mammoth: <a href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth\">Woolly Mammoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\">Mammoth Bull</a> <span class=\"muted\">(53)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b4a74aee3f636c155f14.svg\" alt=\"Tundra Mammoth\"></div><h3>Tundra Mammoth</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>50 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 50–51)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mammoth</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>303</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>32</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>3.1</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}